        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_cd4fe35c84aa46aea54926ca292df901",
      "statement": "A causal verdict requires effective perturbation and comparison coverage: absent a detected leak, the auditor raises rather than returning causal when all probes are ineffective, a cutoff has no effective probe, or a cutoff-feature pair lacks pre-cutoff comparisons.",
